 46 │ 
 47 │ These elision rules strike a balance between ease of use and safety. By automatically inferring lifetimes in common scenarios where they’re safe to do so (like having only one reference parameter), Rust reduces boilerplate code while still maintaining its strong guarantees about memory safety.
    · ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    ·                                                                                                                                                    ╰── Dms tell: dms.machine
