 48 │ 
 49 │ Understanding these rules helps you predict when explicit lifetime annotations are necessary, typically when there’s ambiguity or when multiple references interact differently. This knowledge not only streamlines your coding process but also deepens your understanding of how Rust manages data safely behind the scenes.
    · ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    ·                                                                                                                                                                ╰── Dms tell: dms.machine
